ald's prophecy at the height  of 2019 snowman's land plot arc  Cobblepot finally stabs and kills poor  Tabitha based on Neil Gaiman's legendary  novel showtimes American Gods operates  on the conceit that all the gods anyone  has ever believed  are real in that they wander around the  u.s. in human form having been brought  to the new world hundreds of years prior  and while you might assume that gods are  pretty much unkillable American gods  doesn't agree the show had no qualms  then and bumping off NAB's sweeney an  ancient Irish King turned bird turned  six foot tall leprechaun in the  present-day this scrappy God worked as  muscle for mr. Wednesday leader of the  old gods early in the series however  Matt Sweeney's magical powers failed  when he lost his enchanted coin his luck  and good fortune having come to an end  Sweeney finds himself unable to  understand why his life is falling apart  driven to madness he turns on shadow  moon the show's lead only foreshadow to  stab him in the heart  beeps series finale sees lead character  Selina Meyer become president of the  United States after a series of  machinations and manipulations at her  party's national convention Selina gets  the nomination when she courts Jonah  Ryan support by making him her running  mate and gets buddy Calhoun on board by  agreeing to ban same-sex marriage  one final roadblock is swiftly overcome  after Mayer frames her loyal assistant  Gary for corruption and has him sent to  prison I coulda done it without you  worry I'm not going anywhere the episode  then flashes forward to Selena in the  Oval Office and then to more than 20  years later when Selena's press  secretary turned CBS News reporter Mike  McClintock covers the ex-presidents  funeral veep saves one last joke for its  put-upon protagonist when Mike  interrupts and then ends his coverage of  the presidential memorial to pursue the  breaking news that beloved actor Tom  Hanks has died it sometimes seemed like  the story of Game